userspace components inherited from the AOSP and GrapheneOS trees, Rist Inc. will provide,
to any third party and for three years from the date of each RistOS release, a complete
machine-readable copy of the corresponding source of those components as shipped in that
release, for a charge no more than the cost of physically performing source distribution.
To request it, open an issue using the Other form at
https://github.com/rist-os/rist-os-handset/issues, titled `Source request: <build number>`,
naming the build number of the image you have.

If you have a RistOS image and cannot obtain its corresponding source by either route, that
is a defect in our release process; open an issue and we will treat it as one.

If you redistribute a RistOS image, the same obligation passes to you. Redistributing
the source tarball alongside the image is the simplest way to meet it.
